        "3283": {"synopsis":"Status screen, key EDIT ($07): a new value for the item, 2 or 4 hex digits by its kind\n(INPUT_HEX, ENTER may end early); written into its slot at $3F00 + the slot byte (the high\nbyte too for a word), then the item shown again.\nExit: no carry.","comment":"The item's kind and slot"},
        "3286": {"comment":"Line and item kept"},
        "3287": {"comment":"Kind and slot kept"},
        "3288": {"comment":"Digits from the kind (2 or 4)"},
        "3291": {"comment":"B = the digits"},
        "3292": {"comment":"ENTER may end early, padded with zeros"},
        "3294": {"comment":"C = B + $80"},
        "3295": {"comment":"Read the new value"},
