        "3856": {"comment":"Flipped"},
        "3860": {"synopsis":"Prints at 0,71 'd' when $3F2E bit 6 is set (breakpoints off for all), 'e' otherwise.\nExit: A = 0, no carry.","comment":"AT 0,71"},
