        "3928": {"synopsis":"Breakpoint screen, key 'B': a breakpoint set by page and offset.\n1. The slot emptied (BP_KEY_KILL).\n2. The page in 2 hex digits ($E0 up refused) and the offset in 4 (INPUT_HEX4).\n3. BP_SET. Nothing typed: the slot stays empty, no carry.","comment":"The slot emptied and its line cleared"},
