        "3960": {"synopsis":"Breakpoint screen, key 'A': a breakpoint set by address.\n1. The slot emptied.\n2. An address in 4 hex digits; below $4000 refused.\n3. Its page and offset under the current MMU ($0047), then BP_SET.","comment":"The slot emptied and its line cleared"},
        "3963": {"comment":"An address in 4 digits"},
