        "3977": {"synopsis":"Stores breakpoint slot 20 - B with page A and offset HL: refused (carry) for an offset of\n$1FFA up, or when an enabled-or-not slot in use has the same page and an offset within 6\nbytes. The slot gets the offset with bits 6 (in use) and 7 (enabled) set in its high byte,\nthen the page.\nExit: no carry, stored.","comment":"C = the page"},
