        "4128": {"synopsis":"Prints B numbers in inverse at AT D,E, each in 2 hex digits followed by a space: the bytes\nfrom HL when C bit 7 is set (the NextReg numbers, from $0BFB), otherwise C, C + 1, ... (the\nmemory browser's column heads, from $0803).\nExit: HL and C moved on by B, B = 0.","comment":"AT D,E"},
