        "4600": {"synopsis":"Copies the bit-7-ended text at HL to DE, ended by $FF. A byte with bit 7 that is $40-$5F\nwithout it is a token, not the end: piece (code - $40) of TEXT_TOKENS (the pieces after\n$1AC4, each ended by bit 7) is copied in its place, expanded the same way, and the text goes\non.\nExit: DE = the copy's start, HL = its $FF.\nChanges: AF.","comment":"Its start kept"},
