        "4721": {"synopsis":"Writes a 16K bank to the open file as a block: a 3-byte header ($FF, $FF, B) from $3E54,\nthen 8K pages 2 x C and 2 x C + 1 (WRITE_PAGE).\nEntry: B = the block's number, C = the 16K bank.\nExit: carry, written. From $0719-$0739.","comment":"Block header: $FFFF and B"},
