        "4754": {"synopsis":"Writes 8K page A to the open file. Each 256 bytes is paged in by MAP_PROG_BYTE: through MMU\n4 (H bit 7 set) the whole 8K goes at once, otherwise 256 bytes at a time from its copy at\n$5E00.\nExit: carry, written.","comment":"8K: 32 blocks of 256"},
