        "4790": {"synopsis":"Loads 'c:/nextzxos/enMf<D>.sys' into $F720 unless it is the one loaded already ($3E97 = D):\n1. RESET_STREAMS; $3E97 = 0; $F720-$FEFF filled with $FF.\n2. The name with digit D opened (OPEN_READ); $7E0 bytes read to $F720 with page 7 at $C000\n   (DOS_READ) and closed.\n3. The version word at $F71E + the file's first word must be $0208: then $3E97 = D, no\n   carry.\n4. Otherwise 'Version mismatch:', '0208 enNextMf.rom' and the file's version with its name;\n   or, when it could not be opened, 'Error loading enMf<D>.sys'; printed through ROM 3, a\n   click, carry.\nEntry: D = 1-6, from $03A0, whose caller runs $F722 on no carry.","comment":"Already loaded?"},
        "4793": {"comment":"The same?"},
