        "4963": {"synopsis":"Run at $5B00 (copied there by $043D-$0446, $31 bytes, with ROM 2 selected):\n1. The 256 bytes at $3A54 to $5E00, A = the byte at $3A52; the Multiface paged out (port\n   $BF).\n2. ROM 2's DOS_SET_DRIVE ($012D) with A, then IDE_PATH ($01B1) with A = 0 (change directory)\n   and the path at $5E00.\n3. MMU 5 = page 16; DivMMC bank 11 paged in at $2000 (port $E3 = $8B) and its 8K copied to\n   $A000.\n4. The Multiface paged in (port $3F).","comment":"The 256 bytes at $3A54 to $5E00"},
        "4966": {"comment":"$5E00"},
