        "5012": {"synopsis":"Run at $5B00 (copied there by $0449-$0452, $5B bytes):\n1. The $13C bytes at $3916 to $5E00, the Multiface paged out (port $BF), and copied to $34DE\n   in DivMMC bank 12 (port $E3 = $8C).\n2. On at RESTORE_MEMORY_2.","comment":"$13C bytes at $3916 to $5E00"},
        "5015": {"comment":"$5E00"},
