        "5027": {"comment":"HL = $5E00, BC = $13C"},
        "5029": {"comment":"To DivMMC bank 12 at $34DE"},
        "5034": {"comment":"Port $E3"},
        "5038": {"synopsis":"Also run at $5B00 on its own (copied by $0435-$0452 when $0598 gave carry): the Multiface\npaged out; bank 7 at $C000 (port $7FFD = 7); then from DivMMC RAM: bank 6's $2000-$3AFF to\n$4000 and $3E00-$3FFF to $5E00, bank 4 to $C000-$DFFF, bank 5 to $E000-$FFFF; the DivMMC\npaged off (port $E3 = 0) and the Multiface paged in (port $3F).","comment":"Multiface paged out"},
        "5040": {"comment":"Bank 7 at $C000"},
