        "5103": {"synopsis":"Shows the NMI menu (from $0339): its text at NMI_MENU_TEXT copied to PROG (SHOW_MENU_TEXT)\nand item 0 selected.\nExit: as ROM 0's menu: A = the item chosen, carry when it was left without one.","comment":"The NMI menu's text, $57 bytes"},
        "5106": {"comment":"$57 bytes"},
        "5109": {"synopsis":"Shows a menu through ROM 0's MENU_SHOW:\n1. The BC bytes at HL copied to PROG, $FF after them.\n2. $F700 = A, the item selected (0 from here); $D742 = PROG, the menu.\n3. ROM 0's $069F, inside MENU_SHOW, run on a stack at $5BFF (SP kept at $5B6A, which is\n   $5BFF again afterwards).\nEntry: HL = the menu text, BC = its length. Also from $0761 (the Debug menu).","comment":"Copied to PROG"},
        "5115": {"comment":"$FF after it"},
        "5117": {"comment":"Stored"},
        "5118": {"comment":"Item 0 selected"},
